<p class="NormRef"><a name="iso19143" id="iso19143"></a>International Organization for Standardization (committee): ISO&#xA0;19143:2010, <i>Geographic information&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;Filter encoding</i>. International Organization for Standardization, Geneva (2010). <a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/42137.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/42137.html</a>.</p>
