    <div style="mso-element:footnote-list"><div style="mso-element:footnote" id="ftn1">
  <p class="MsoFootnoteText"><a name="_8f40ee05-7a7d-dcc0-440f-703a820e6b39" id="_8f40ee05-7a7d-dcc0-440f-703a820e6b39"></a><a style="mso-footnote-id:ftn1" href="#_ftn1" name="_ftnref1" title="" id="_ftnref1"><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="mso-special-character:footnote"></span></span></a>www.opengeospatial.org/compliance_cite</p>
</div>
<div style="mso-element:footnote" id="ftn2">
  <p class="MsoFootnoteText"><a name="_e6ac0454-93e0-0721-3bb0-4811a2d19ce6" id="_e6ac0454-93e0-0721-3bb0-4811a2d19ce6"></a><a style="mso-footnote-id:ftn2" href="#_ftn2" name="_ftnref2" title="" id="_ftnref2"><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="mso-special-character:footnote"></span></span></a>Elaboration of this and other &#x201C;Best Practices&#x201D; in the construction of conformant DGGS implementations will be included in a forthcoming &#x201C;Best Practice&#x201D; document to be published by the DGGS SWG following adoption of this Standard.</p>
</div>
<div style="mso-element:footnote" id="ftn3">
  <p class="MsoFootnoteText"><a name="_0fca2582-9552-85ab-15a0-e7542f78f57d" id="_0fca2582-9552-85ab-15a0-e7542f78f57d"></a><a style="mso-footnote-id:ftn3" href="#_ftn3" name="_ftnref3" title="" id="_ftnref3"><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="mso-special-character:footnote"></span></span></a>Specific DGGS interoperability Interface Protocols will be elaborated in a series OGC Extension Standard documents to this standard.</p>
</div>
</div>
